guide forever/horde/tauren/01-mulgore
title Camp Narache, Mulgore & Thunder Bluff
faction Horde
race Tauren
levels 1-10
zone Mulgore
next forever/horde/02-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for Tauren (world 5b662c40).
#
# Mulgore 1-8.1 (21 quests, bind Bloodhoof Village), Thunder Bluff 8.1-8.3
# (Traditions of the Bluff, The Longwalkers; flight path), then the Crossroads
# (flight path, bind) and the simulator's grind to 10 there. The Barrens
# 11-15 quests are in forever/horde/02-barrens.
#
# Order: the simulator's, except that Break Sharptusk! and The Adventurer are
# taken while you are at Camp Narache instead of on separate trips back, and
# Grace of An'she and Mu'sha goes straight to the shrine (the incense burns
# for ten minutes). Thunderhorn Totem is handed in at Bloodhoof once its
# claws are done.
#
# Class trip at 10: Thunder Bluff for training and the class quests the next
# guide continues (Warrior 1505, Shaman 1523, Hunter taming chain to 6089,
# Druid bear chain and Teleport: Moonglade), then back to the Crossroads.
#
# Flow: Camp Narache -> plainstriders and cougars -> Seer Graytongue -> the
# shrine of An'she and Mu'sha -> Brambleblade Ravine -> Camp Narache ->
# Bloodhoof Village (bind) -> Winterhoof Water Well -> Chakuyak and the
# western plains -> hearth -> the Ravaged Caravan -> Venture Co. Mine ->
# Palemane Rock escort -> Thunder Bluff -> the Crossroads (grind to 10) ->
# Thunder Bluff (class trip) -> the Crossroads.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Camp Narache

step Camp Narache
  tip You start on the mesa of Camp Narache. Grull and the chief stand by the big tent in the middle.
  accept 747                          -- Grull Hawkwind
  accept 752                          -- Chief Hawkwind

step Plainstriders
  tip Plainstriders roam the grass all around the camp.
  collect 4740 quest 747.1
  collect 4739 quest 747.2

step Grull Hawkwind
  turnin 747
  accept 750
  train class

step Greatmother Hawkwind
  tip Greatmother Hawkwind sits by the tent on the camp's eastern edge; the Water Pitcher stands next to her.
  turnin 752
  accept 753
  collect 4755 quest 753.1

step Chief Hawkwind
  turnin 753
  accept 755

step Antur Fallow
  tip Antur stands at the west end of the camp.
  accept 1656

step Mountain cougars
  tip Mountain Cougars prowl the hills south of the camp.
  goto 42.5,86.0 "Mountain cougars"
  collect 4742 quest 750.1

step Grull Hawkwind
  turnin 750
  accept 780
  accept 3376                         -- Brave Windfeather, next to Grull
  train class

step Seer Graytongue
  tip Follow the path south out of camp to the Seer's tent at the foot of the hills.
  turnin 755
  accept 95805
  accept 757

step The shrine of An'she and Mu'sha
  tip The incense burns out in ten minutes: run straight east along the southern hills to the Ritual Fire.
  turnin 95805

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Brambleblade Ravine

step Brambleblade Ravine
  tip Battleboars graze north of the shrine; the Bristleback quilboar hold the ravine to the north-east. Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle stands at its eastern end, and the Dirt-stained Map lies on the ground in the camp.
  goto 57.5,79.5 "Brambleblade Ravine"
  collect 4848 quest 780.1
  collect 4849 quest 780.2
  collect 4770 quest 757.1
  collect 10459 quest 3376.1
  collect 4851
  accept 781

step Camp Narache
  tip Back west to the camp.
  turnin 780                          -- Grull Hawkwind
  turnin 3376                         -- Brave Windfeather
  turnin 781                          -- Chief Hawkwind
  turnin 757
  accept 763
  accept 96659

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bloodhoof Village

step Bloodhoof Village
  tip Follow the road north out of Red Cloud Mesa to Bloodhoof Village. Kaga Wildhoof waits on the road just south of the village.
  turnin 96659                        -- Kaga Wildhoof
  sethome "Bloodhoof Village" npc 6747  -- Innkeeper Kauth
  turnin 1656
  turnin 763                          -- Baine Bloodhoof
  accept 96130                        -- Yaw Sharpmane
  accept 748                          -- Mull Thunderhorn

step Poison Water
  tip Prairie Wolves and Adult Plainstriders roam the plains around the village.
  collect 4758 quest 748.1
  collect 4759 quest 748.2

step Mull Thunderhorn
  turnin 748
  accept 754
  train class

step Winterhoof Water Well
  tip The well lies south-east of the village.
  use 5411 quest 754.1 @51.8,68.4     -- Winterhoof Cleansing Totem

step Mull Thunderhorn
  turnin 754
  accept 756

step Chakuyak
  tip Chakuyak, a lone wolf, prowls the plains west of the village.
  collect 270302 quest 96130.1

step Prairie Stalkers and Flatland Cougars
  tip Stalkers and cougars roam the plains north and west of the village.
  collect 4801 quest 756.1
  collect 4802 quest 756.2

step Back to Bloodhoof
  hearth "Bloodhoof Village"
  turnin 96130                        -- Yaw Sharpmane
  turnin 756                          -- Mull Thunderhorn

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterhoof and the Ravaged Caravan

step Winterhoof Water Well
  tip Morin Cloudstalker camps by the well south-east of Bloodhoof, Malah Longwind a little further east.
  accept 749                          -- Morin Cloudstalker
  accept 99081                        -- Malah Longwind

step The Ravaged Caravan
  tip The wrecked caravan lies north of the well, east of the road to Thunder Bluff.
  turnin 749
  accept 751

step Brave Wildrunner
  tip Back to Bloodhoof Village.
  turnin 99081

step Morin Cloudstalker
  turnin 751
  accept 764
  accept 765

step The Venture Co. Mine
  tip The goblins work the mine in the hills north-east of the well. Fizsprocket stands in the back of the mine.
  goto 59.5,47.0 "The Venture Co. Mine"
  kill 2978 quest 764.1
  kill 2979 quest 764.2
  collect 4819 quest 765.1

step Morin Cloudstalker
  turnin 764
  turnin 765

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Palemane Rock

step Perith Stormhoof
  tip Perith is held in the gnoll camp at Palemane Rock, west of Bloodhoof. Lead him out of the camp.
  accept 98430
  complete 98430

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Head north up the road to Thunder Bluff and ride a lift up to the mesas. Tal keeps the wind riders on the central rise.
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal
  train class

step Eylah Sunhorn
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Buy a Bundle of Herbs from Nida, Ceder Twigs from Nata, Sinew Thread from Mahu and Ceremonial Flint and Tinder from Naal, all on the central rise, combine them and sprinkle the incense off Hunter's Rise.
  accept 97485
  goto 57.5,88.0 "Hunter Rise"        -- Combine the four items into Prepared Incense and spread it off Hunter Rise
  turnin 97485

step Cairne Bloodhoof
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Cairne stands in the great tent on the central rise.
  turnin 98430

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ride down from Thunder Bluff and follow the road south-east past Bloodhoof Village and east out of Mulgore through the pass into the Barrens. At Camp Taurajo turn north onto the Gold Road and follow it to the Crossroads.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
  level 10                            -- Raptors, zhevras and plainstriders around the town

